# Daretti's +2 with no cards in hand: there is nothing to discard (up to two), so nothing is asked and, drawing "that
# many", nothing is drawn: the library is untouched and the loyalty cost is still paid. Every card of Bot1's hand is
# cast first (five Moxen and a Black Lotus pay for Daretti and cost nothing more).

[Bot1 Deck]
Daretti, Scrap Savant
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Black Lotus
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
